  message: "Pool-recursion fix landed in PR #3442 (commit b6ba05735, merged 2026-04-29). bakeoff-{broad,deep} and dead-code-prospector-run.py now accept --pool ~/ALL_REPOS, recursing one or two levels into collection directories with realpath-based dedup. Companion pre-commit-hook-self-match fix landed in PR #3443 (commit c1c727307, merged 2026-04-29) — see prior discussion entry for details. Three priority/artifacts docs updated to reference ~/ALL_REPOS."  # 5700
